sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Ops as Operator
    participant CP as Cluster Manager
    participant NEW as New Node D
    participant A as Node A
    participant B as Node B

    Ops->>CP: add Node D to ring
    CP->>NEW: join cluster
    CP->>A: replicate keys in range (C→D)
    CP->>B: replicate keys in range (B→D)
    Note over A,B,NEW: Only keys between predecessor and D move
    CP-->>Ops: rebalance complete
